Now that's playing with your head.

54
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,060
Uh-huh.

55
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:13,040
Well, that's one way to receive.

56
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:17,500
I knew my hands wouldn't reach it in time, so I used my face.

57
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,580
I just didn't want to get hit in the nose.

58
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:20,160
What?

59
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,520
You mean...

60
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:22,540
That wasn't an accident?

61
00:04:22,540 --> 00:04:26,840
Well, they'd bench me if I got a nosebleed, right?

62
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:38,540
I had heard the rumors about Karasuno's first-year duo.

63
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:43,440
Then I met them one day, and the little ones started to get cocky.

64
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:47,700
I assumed he'd be like all the other small players I've dealt with,

65
00:04:47,980 --> 00:04:50,940
who compensated for their short stature with excellent technique.

66
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,920
But I was wrong.

67
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:57,680
He shows no sign of the talent or intelligence of those other players.

68
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,920
But now...

69
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:03,240
I see it.

70
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,600
There's just something about him.

71
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:08,920
Something I can't stand.

72
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:13,660
It's not that I have any doubt that we'll win this game.

73
00:05:16,540 --> 00:05:19,660
But above all, I want to defeat him.

74
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:23,440
And I want the weight of that loss to crush him.

75
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:34,040
Alright, that's the spirit!

76
00:05:34,380 --> 00:05:35,620
Don't give up, you guys!

77
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,220
Hey, look over there!

78
00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:39,280
He's doing warm-ups!

79
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:42,520
