116
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:35,840
I never wonder if the ball is ever going to be sent to me.

117
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,260
It doesn't matter.

118
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:40,580
Instead, I just tell myself that I'm ready to hit.

119
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:43,240
That confidence is coming from all of us at once.

120
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:44,980
